# Authorized SSH keys for agentic-repos Git Server
# Format: username:ssh-key-type public-key comment
#
# Examples:
# developer1:ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGq4... developer1@company.com
# admin:ssh-rsa AAAAB3NzaC1yc2EAAAADAQABAAABgQC... admin@company.com
#
# To add a user:
# 1. Get their SSH public key (from ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub or similar)
# 2. Add a line below with format: username:key-type public-key comment
# 3. Restart the server or it will automatically reload

# Example entries (replace with real keys):
git:ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIExample1234567890abcdef git@server.local
developer:ssh-rsa AAAAB3NzaC1yc2EAAAADAQABAAABgQDExample1234567890 developer@company.com